%% title: Packet
%% alt: A packet diagram of a tagged tuios wire frame: length, message type, codec, request id and payload, in rows of 32 bits
packet
  title A tagged tuios wire frame
  0-31: "Length of the rest of the frame"
  32-39: "Message type"
  40-47: "Codec"
  48-111: "Request id"
  112-127: "gob payload"
